      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 3 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 1 \\leq H,W \\leq 30; 1 \\leq K < H+W; 1 \\leq A_{i,j} \\leq 10^9; All values in input are integers."
